ng novelty.\nScore 2.\n\nWe must output rating echoing id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence then <subscale>.\n\nFormat? Probably JSON or list. Instruction: Return rating ... For each subscale... give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first and then \"<subscale>\". Could output as lines.\n\nI'll output structured:\n\nid: P2115\napplicability_evidence: ...\napplicability: 4\n...\n\nEnsure one sentence evidence.\n\nLet's produce final.",
