w to meet logging mandate and/or adapt R&D. Centralised service addresses logging mandate directly. So 4.\n\nEffectiveness (1-4): degree will solve problem.\n4 = reasonable and will solve stated problem without regard for workability\n3 = reasonable and will contribute to solution\n2 = unreasonable unlikely\n1 = solves unrelated\n\nIt will meet Article 12 requirement for automatic recording over lifetime, traceability. Seems will solve main problem. So 4.\n\nWe need format: echo id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence then <subscale>.\n\nProbably JSON? Output rating. Provide lines.\n\nI'll output:\n\nid: P1074\nacceptability_evidence: ...\nacceptability: 4\n...\n\nEnsure one sentence evidence.\n\nLet's produce.\n\n",
